## Customer Insights

![Customer Insights](Customer Insights.png)

This dashboard focuses on understanding customer purchasing behaviour and identifying key revenue contributors.

Using the transformed SQL retail dataset in Power BI, I analysed customer order patterns, revenue contribution, and concentration of sales among high-value customers.

Key insights explored in this dashboard include:

• Distribution of customer orders to identify purchasing patterns  
• Revenue vs order frequency to detect high-value customers  
• Identification of the top customers driving a large portion of total revenue  

The analysis highlights that revenue is highly concentrated among a small number of customers, with the top customers contributing a significant share of total sales.

This type of analysis helps businesses identify:
- high-value customers
- potential VIP segments
- opportunities for targeted marketing or retention strategies
